@startuml
title US10 - Register a Test Type\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

Admin -> System : The Administrator asks to register a Test Type
System --> Admin : The system requests the Internal Code, NHS Code,\nand collection-method description
Admin -> System : The Administrator provides the requested information
System --> Admin : The system registers the Test Type and informs\nthe Administrator that the operation succeeded

@enduml
